## Why This Is Asked

Probes end-to-end performance testing at multi-region, cache-heavy scale with backpressure and autoscaling—key for Netflix/Oracle-like systems. Requires concrete load models, realistic failure patterns, and measurable acceptance criteria.

## Key Concepts

- Cache stampede and TTL misconfigurations
- Backpressure propagation and origin failover
- Multi-region load shaping and autoscaling validation
- Observability and SLA adherence

